            {
              "id": "art-body",
              "type": "column",
              "props": {
                "span": 9
              },
              "children": [
                {
                  "id": "lede",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "For trucking companies and owner-operators, downtime isn't just inconvenient. It directly impacts revenue. When a truck is parked in a shop instead of on the road, deliveries are delayed, drivers are waiting, and profits take a hit.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full",
                    "anchor": "post-lede"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-intro-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "That's why more fleet managers are investing in fleet truck maintenance services that keep vehicles running reliably. Preventative maintenance helps fleets stay ahead of costly breakdowns and unexpected repairs. Instead of reacting to problems after they happen, the right maintenance partner helps identify potential issues early and address them before they disrupt operations. At Sun State International, we work with trucking companies every day to provide dependable fleet maintenance and trucking service that keeps their trucks on the road where they belong.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-real-cost",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "The Real Cost of Truck Downtime",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "real-cost"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-real-cost-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Many fleet owners underestimate how expensive downtime can be. The average cost of truck downtime can cost hundreds per vehicle per day, depending on the operation and type of freight being hauled. That could include lost contracts, missed delivery windows, or driver frustration.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-real-cost-2",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "This is where professional fleet truck maintenance services make a real difference. A consistent maintenance schedule helps reduce unexpected breakdowns and ensures your trucks remain dependable throughout their lifecycle. For owner-operators and fleet managers, that reliability directly supports profitability.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-what-services-include",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "What Fleet Truck Maintenance Services Typically Include",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "what-services-include"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-what-services-include-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Not all maintenance programs are the same. A comprehensive fleet maintenance truck service should cover both routine maintenance and more complex mechanical needs. Common services include:",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "checks-what-services-include-2",
                  "type": "check-list",
                  "props": {
                    "items": [
                      {
                        "title": "Preventative Maintenance Inspections",
                        "text": "Routine inspections identify issues before they become major problems. Technicians check critical systems including brakes, suspension, electrical components, and cooling systems."
                      },
                      {
                        "title": "Oil Changes and Fluid Checks",
                        "text": "Regular fluid maintenance protects engines and transmissions from premature wear."
                      },
                      {
                        "title": "Brake and Tire Service",
                        "text": "Brake systems and tires are among the most important safety components in any truck fleet. Regular inspections help prevent dangerous failures on the road."
                      },
                      {
                        "title": "Engine Diagnostics",
                        "text": "Modern trucks rely heavily on electronic systems. Diagnostics allow technicians to quickly identify performance issues and recommend repairs."
                      },
                      {
                        "title": "Parts Replacement",
                        "text": "Components like belts, filters, and sensors wear down over time. Replacing them before failure helps prevent unexpected downtime."
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-what-services-include-3",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "At Sun State International, our service teams are experienced in working with commercial trucks and understand the unique demands placed on fleet vehicles.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "co-what-services-include-4-row",
                  "type": "row",
                  "props": {
                    "gap": 0
                  },
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "id": "co-what-services-include-4",
