                },
                {
                  "id": "h-extends-life",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Preventative Maintenance Extends the Life of Your Fleet",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "extends-life"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-extends-life-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "For fleet owners, trucks represent one of the largest investments in their business. Proper truck fleet maintenance services help protect that investment by extending the life of key components. Engines, transmissions, and braking systems last longer when they are regularly inspected and serviced.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-extends-life-2",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Preventative maintenance also helps fleets avoid the higher costs associated with emergency repairs. Instead of dealing with sudden breakdowns that interrupt your schedule, maintenance allows you to plan service appointments around your operational needs. This proactive approach keeps trucks reliable and drivers confident on the road.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-reliable-parts",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Reliable Parts Make Maintenance More Effective",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "reliable-parts"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-reliable-parts-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Maintenance only works if the parts being installed are dependable. When replacing worn components, using high-quality semi truck parts helps ensure the repair lasts and performs properly. Low-quality parts may save money upfront, but they often lead to repeat repairs and additional downtime.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-reliable-parts-2",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Fleet operators should work with suppliers who provide reliable International truck parts that match manufacturer standards. At Sun State International, our parts department supports fleet maintenance with quality components designed specifically for International trucks.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-order-parts-online",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Order Parts Online When You Need Them",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "order-parts-online"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-order-parts-online-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "For fleet managers who prefer to handle certain maintenance tasks internally, ordering parts online can save valuable time. The Sun State International Online Parts Store allows customers to quickly locate the International truck parts they need and arrange pickup or delivery. Having access to dependable parts helps fleets stay on schedule and maintain consistent performance.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "co-order-parts-online-2-row",
                  "type": "row",
                  "props": {
                    "gap": 0
                  },
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "id": "co-order-parts-online-2",
                      "type": "column",
                      "props": {
                        "span": 12
                      },
                      "styles": {
