                },
                {
                  "id": "h-improves-safety",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "How Professional Fleet Maintenance Improves Safety",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "improves-safety"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-improves-safety-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Beyond reliability, maintenance plays a major role in road safety. Regular fleet maintenance ensures that critical systems like brakes, steering, suspension, and lighting are operating correctly. This reduces the risk of accidents and helps drivers feel confident behind the wheel.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-improves-safety-2",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "For fleet owners, safety also means protecting their drivers, cargo, and reputation. Companies that invest in consistent fleet maintenance and trucking service demonstrate a commitment to responsible operations. Over time, that commitment builds trust with customers and partners.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-right-partner",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Choosing the Right Fleet Maintenance Partner",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "right-partner"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-right-partner-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Not every service provider understands the demands of commercial trucking. When evaluating fleet truck maintenance services, fleet owners should look for providers that offer:",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "checks-right-partner-2",
                  "type": "check-list",
                  "props": {
                    "items": [
                      {
                        "text": "Experienced commercial truck technicians"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Access to reliable International truck parts"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Quick turnaround times"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Clear communication and scheduling"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Convenient parts ordering and service coordination"
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-right-partner-3",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "At Sun State International, our mission is to provide quality transportation products, parts, and services while supporting our customers' long-term success. We understand that when your trucks are running smoothly, your entire operation benefits. Our service teams focus on delivering dependable maintenance and straightforward support that fleet operators can trust.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "fig-2",
                  "type": "image",
                  "props": {
                    "width": "full",
