                      "src": "/img/blog/how-fleet-truck-maintenance-services-reduce-downtime/2.jpg",
                      "width": 1280,
                      "height": 853,
                      "alt": "Sun State International team members standing among commercial trucks in the service shop"
                    }
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-keep-fleet-moving",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Keep Your Fleet Moving with Sun State International",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "keep-fleet-moving"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-keep-fleet-moving-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Reliable trucks are the backbone of every trucking business. Investing in professional fleet truck maintenance services helps reduce downtime, improve safety, and protect the long-term value of your fleet. With experienced technicians, quality parts, and a commitment to dependable service, Sun State International is here to support fleets across Florida. If your trucks need routine maintenance, diagnostics, or repairs, our team is ready to help keep your fleet moving.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
